OL,3,GNEWSAWoman stabbed 11 times by         
OL,4,Aestranged husband, inquest told        
OL,6,FA woman was stabbed by her estranged   
OL,7,Fhusband just two days after police     
OL,8,Fclosed an investigation into           
OL,9,Fallegations he had poured petrol over  
OL,10,Fher head and threatened to set her on  
OL,11,Ffire, an inquest jury has heard.       
OL,13,FA double inquest into the deaths of    
OL,14,F49-year-old Vica Gheorghe and her      
OL,15,Fhusband Marian, 52, was told they were 
OL,16,Ffound wounded at her home on Caludon   
OL,17,FRoad in the city in April 2024.        
