OL,3,GNEWSAWoman stabbed 11 times by         
OL,4,Aestranged husband, inquest told        
OL,6,FCoventry Coroner's Court was told Vica 
OL,7,FGheorghe had been stabbed 11 times and 
OL,8,Fdied in hospital later that day, while 
OL,9,Fher estranged husband was dead at the  
OL,10,Fscene from a stab wound to the chest.  
OL,12,FOpening the proceedings, assistant     
OL,13,Fcoroner Tom Leeper said the events on 5
OL,14,FApril came two days after Marian       
OL,15,FGheorghe was told he would face no     
OL,16,Ffurther police action over an alleged  
OL,17,Fattempt to kidnap his wife.            
